<title>UK: BTI sets call warrants on Electricidade de Portuga.</title>
<headline>BTI sets call warrants on Electricidade de Portuga.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International said it has issued two million American-style call warrants on shares of Electricidade de Portugal SA.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by one warrant.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,500 PTE		 ISSUE PRICE  13.35 PCT</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   06.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  3,425 PTE</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
